IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q19-CUSTOMER-RECORD.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CUSTOMER-ID PIC X(12).
01 WS-NAME PIC X(40).
01 WS-ACCOUNT-TYPE PIC X(20).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-ID
    ACCEPT WS-NAME
    ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT-TYPE
    DISPLAY "Customer ID: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CUSTOMER-ID)
    DISPLAY "Name: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NAME)
    DISPLAY "Account Type: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ACCOUNT-TYPE)
    STOP RUN.
